---
description: UI components must not contain health business logic
globs: src/app/**/*.tsx,src/ui/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# UI has no business logic

Screens and `src/ui` components render state. They do not compute HRV, recovery, strain, or sleep scores.

- No SQL, BLE, or Xiaomi protocol in components.
- Placeholder screens may show static copy that the screen is not wired yet.
- Do not hardcode production health numbers except in the archived `App.tsx` mock.
- When data exists: missing value → `—`, never a made-up metric.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
const recovery = (hrv / rhr) * 100;

// ✅ GOOD
<Text>{summary.recoveryPercent ?? '—'}</Text>
```
